.TH AVR\-BUILDER 1 "" "avr" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-builder \- Manage remote builder sessions.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr builder
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage remote builder sessions.
.PP
Builder sessions are the ephemeral VMs behind `avr build`. `avr build` normally creates and deletes its own, but a crashed client leaves its session running until the TTL expires — `list` finds those, `stop` reclaims them (and their quota) immediately.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
list
List builder sessions, newest first.
.TP
stop
Stop a builder session, reclaiming its VM and quota slot.
